SUMMARY:The Nature Conservancy Little Sit Event Cape May
DESCRIPTION:What is a Little Sit? A spin on the annual\, international birding event The Big Sit\, this event takes that idea and slows it down. Join the Nature Conservancy and the Cape May Bird Observatory staff for a fun\, educational challenge to see how many birds we can identify from one location. In the fall\, South Cape May Meadows is the perfect location to see migrating shorebirds\, songbirds and raptors. As a part of this event\, we will have benches for sitting\, binoculars and spotting scopes for viewing\, and educational materials to assist with bird identification. No matter your level of birding experience\, you are welcome to help us add to our morning species total!! An ASL interpreter will be provided for this event. No need to pre-register\, simply show up for a fun morning of birding! \nRAIN DATE will be Sunday October 4 \nLocation Information: South Cape May Meadows\, Sunset Blvd\, Cape May\, NJ. \nClick the following link for directions: https://maps.app.goo.gl/VFXqNr2iiEUg473g8 \nParking: Three designated accessible parking spaces with aisle access on paved concrete. Additionally\, there are 37 standard car spaces on compact gravel. Restroom: An ADA-compliant portable restroom is situated near the parking area. Trained service animals are welcome. \n\n\n\nCLICK HERE FOR MORE INFO \n 
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/the-nature-conservancy-little-sit-event-cape-may-4/
LOCATION:The Nature Conservancy’s South Cape May Meadows\, 692 Sunset Blvd\, Cape May\, NJ\, 08204\, United States
CATEGORIES:Birding,Cape May Bird Observatory,Cape May Bird Observatory's Northwood Center,Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://njaudubon.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/TNC-Little-Sit-05-2025.jpeg
GEO:38.9380767895;-74.9446344028
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Nature Conservancy’s South Cape May Meadows 692 Sunset Blvd Cape May NJ 08204 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=692 Sunset Blvd:geo:-74.9446344028,38.9380767895
END:VEVENT
