SUMMARY:Fall Native Plant Sale
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an exceptional native plant sale celebrating the beauty and ecological importance of our region’s indigenous flora! Lorrimer Sanctuary\, presents a carefully curated selection of native species perfect for fall planting. Discover over 30 native plant species that support local wildlife and thrive in our regional climate. Naturalists will be available to help you make the perfect selection.\n\nFor more information visit: Fall Native Plant Sale | Facebook
