SUMMARY:Monarch Drop-In at the Nature Center of Cape May
DESCRIPTION:Stop by NJ Audubon’s Nature Center of Cape May to learn about the Monarch Monitoring Project. The team may be tagging monarchs\, tending to the gardens that support the monarchs\, or engaged in other project activity. No reservations needed for this free program\, but contributions to the Monarch Monitoring Project are welcome. NO preregistration required. Family-friendly \nMeeting Location: Meets at the Nature Center of Cape May\, located at 1600 Delaware Ave in Cape May. \nCost: FREE – contributions to the Monarch Monitoring Project are welcome.  \nInterested in becoming a member? Please click on the following link to learn more or join: Become a Member today!
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/monarch-drop-in-at-the-nature-center-of-cape-may-5/2026-10-05/
